\setbeamercolor{frametitle}{bg=white,fg=xyyg}% 帧标题背景白色，文字校红色
\setbeamercolor{title}{bg=xyyg}% 标题页背景校红色
%\setbeamerfont{frametitle}{size=\large}
\setbeamerfont{frametitle}{series=\bfseries,size=\large}%,parent=structure} 帧标题加粗，字号large
